{
  "$comment": [
    "Three projects over one local pair, so the handoff can be forced and measured:",
    "  source-only  admits only local/<SOURCE>",
    "  target-only  admits only local/<TARGET>",
    "  pair         admits local/*; the router chooses per turn",
    "run_pair.py replays one conversation under source-only, then re-sends the same",
    "history under target-only. The target's first turn is the cold prefill a mapped",
    "cache would skip. Model names below must match serve_pair.sh and env.sh.",
    "Secrets are never in this file: run mint_keys.py to fill key_sha256 and write",
    "keys.local.json (gitignored)."
  ],
  "projects": [
    {
      "id": "source-only",
      "name": "Source model only",
      "policy": {
        "min_quality": 0.0,
        "allow": [
          "local/Qwen/Qwen3-8B"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "target-only",
      "name": "Target model only",
      "policy": {
        "min_quality": 0.0,
        "allow": [
          "local/Qwen/Qwen3-14B"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pair",
      "name": "Either local model",
      "policy": {
        "min_quality": 0.0,
        "allow": [
          "local/*"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
